# Local User Settings & Layouts
# -----------------------------
# These files store your personal IDE preferences, open tabs, and window positions.
# Keeping these tracked will cause constant git conflicts if working with others.
# Note: Ensure you keep 'options/main/' itself, but ignore the dynamically generated local states.
options/main/inherited/

# Ignore the project's local user configuration folder completely
# (Contains local paths, recent files, and IDE states)
.config/